<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:41:43 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>摩科瑞在埃尼合资公司之前聘请亚历克斯·汉弗莱斯 (Alex Humphries) 担任燃料油贸易全球主管</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/mercuria-hires-alex-humphries-as-global-head-of-fuel-oil-trading-ahead-of-eni-jv</link><description>Mercuria Energy Group Ltd. 聘请了 BP Plc 的 Alex Humphries 担任燃料油贸易主管，这是该公司与 Eni SpA 建立贸易合资企业之前的高级任命名单。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/mercuria-hires-alex-humphries-as-global-head-of-fuel-oil-trading-ahead-of-eni-jv'&gt;摩科瑞在埃尼合资公司之前聘请亚历克斯·汉弗莱斯 (Alex Humphries) 担任燃料油贸易全球主管&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mercuria Hires Alex Humphries as Global Head of Fuel Oil Trading Ahead of Eni JV&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/mercuria-hires-alex-humphries-as-global-head-of-fuel-oil-trading-ahead-of-eni-jv</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:53:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>土耳其释放因基金丑闻被捕的前部长 18 天后</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/turkey-frees-ex-minister-arrested-in-fund-scandal-after-18-days</link><description>土耳其前部长法特玛·贝图尔·萨扬·卡亚 (Fatma Betul Sayan Kaya) 在一次震动该国市场的投资基金调查中被捕，仅 18 天后就被释放出狱。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/turkey-frees-ex-minister-arrested-in-fund-scandal-after-18-days'&gt;土耳其释放因基金丑闻被捕的前部长 18 天后&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey Frees Ex-Minister Arrested in Fund Scandal After 18 Days&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/turkey-frees-ex-minister-arrested-in-fund-scandal-after-18-days</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:40:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>标普 500 指数波动撕毁剧本，市场择时者接受教育</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/market-timers-get-schooled-as-s-p-500-swings-rip-up-playbooks</link><description>避免股市下跌通常意味着错过最大的单日涨幅。那些在上周美国股市暴跌后套现的人刚刚吸取了惨痛的教训。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/market-timers-get-schooled-as-s-p-500-swings-rip-up-playbooks'&gt;标普 500 指数波动撕毁剧本，市场择时者接受教育&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Market Timers Get Schooled as S&amp;P 500 Swings Rip Up Playbooks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/market-timers-get-schooled-as-s-p-500-swings-rip-up-playbooks</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:41:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着投资者权衡美联储前景和股市收益，金价小幅走低</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-gain-after-nvidia-s-rehiring-of-huang-sparks-rally</link><description>金价周一大幅反弹后小幅走低，投资者权衡即将公布的美国通胀数据以及股市能否维持快速复苏。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-gain-after-nvidia-s-rehiring-of-huang-sparks-rally'&gt;随着投资者权衡美联储前景和股市收益，金价小幅走低&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Edges Lower as Investors Weigh Fed Outlook, Equity Gains&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-gain-after-nvidia-s-rehiring-of-huang-sparks-rally</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:06:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 24 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24</link><description>由于有关油轮进一步袭击的报道掩盖了解决美伊战争的最新外交努力，油价上涨。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24'&gt;11 月 24 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 24&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:04:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着英伟达的衰落和贸易担忧的回归，股市下跌：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>科技巨头的抛售阻止了股市的反弹，市场也受到美国新关税担忧的打击。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;随着英伟达的衰落和贸易担忧的回归，股市下跌：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Fall as Nvidia Fades and Trade Fears Return: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:06:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Anthropic 在上市后第四个交易日跌破 83 美元 IPO 价格</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading</link><description>Anthropic PBC 股价跌破 83 美元的首次公开募股价格，抹去了涌入该人工智能实验室创纪录首次亮相的投资者的收益。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading'&gt;Anthropic 在上市后第四个交易日跌破 83 美元 IPO 价格&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic Falls Below $83 IPO Price in Fourth Post-Debut Session&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/anthropic-breaks-below-83-ipo-price-in-premarket-trading</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:19:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>深圳征服了科技，现在它需要文化（视频）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/shenzhen-